  "details": "We have no way of knowing what it is about the content in that world that has ruffled your feathers.\n\nUnable to identify any clear criteria, we are left simply trembling at the risk of sanctions.\n\nI know how to resolve this.\n\nThe solution is to clearly and specifically point out where the content is in breach, issue one or two warnings, allow time for correction, and only then impose sanctions if the issue remains unresolved.\n\nIt may not be a command issued by a machine, but surely it is fair to call it a ‘feature’ when administrators act within the world according to certain rules?",
